WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lab overview. Worker admission, queue health and completed analyses in one place.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sample library. Search the corpus and filter samples by their reviewed family associations.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Reviewed families. Canonical names retain aliases and separate catalog review from exact lineage.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Family evidence. Accepted closest matches preserve confidence, historical claims and evidence limits.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Sample workspace. A completed six-stage analysis brings findings and coverage limits together.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Saved execution runs. Explore recorded events, timelines and preserved artifacts from isolated runs.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Analysis reports. Review report revisions and the evidence behind each conclusion.
